### Usuarios: modalidad JWT. Hasta que exista el login, pega un access token válido.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = <access_token>

### getAll: nunca devuelve password
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### getOne
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### permisos efectivos (cadena RBAC activa)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 401: sin token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### 400: id inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
